# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Latar Belakang {#background}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tutorial demonstrates how to solve the Market Split problem using [Kipu Quantum's Iskay quantum optimizer](/guides/kipu-optimization) [\\[1\\]](#references). The Market Split problem represents a real-world resource allocation challenge where markets must be partitioned into balanced sales regions to meet exact demand targets.\n"
msgstr "Tutorial ini menunjukkan cara menyelesaikan masalah Market Split menggunakan [Iskay quantum optimizer dari Kipu Quantum](/guides/kipu-optimization) [\\[1\\]](#references). Masalah Market Split mewakili cabaran pengagihan sumber dunia nyata di mana pasaran perlu dibahagikan kepada kawasan jualan yang seimbang untuk memenuhi sasaran permintaan yang tepat.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Market Split challenge {#the-market-split-challenge}"
msgstr "Cabaran Market Split {#the-market-split-challenge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Market Split problem presents a deceptively simple yet computationally formidable challenge in resource allocation. Consider a company with $m$ products being sold across $n$ different markets, where each market purchases a specific bundle of products (represented by the columns of matrix $A$). The business objective is to partition these markets into two balanced sales regions such that each region receives exactly half the total demand for every product.\n"
msgstr "Masalah Market Split menghadirkan cabaran yang kelihatan mudah tetapi amat sukar dari segi pengiraan dalam pengagihan sumber. Bayangkan sebuah syarikat dengan $m$ produk yang dijual merentasi $n$ pasaran berbeza, di mana setiap pasaran membeli satu set produk tertentu (diwakili oleh lajur matriks $A$). Objektif perniagaan adalah untuk membahagikan pasaran-pasaran ini kepada dua kawasan jualan yang seimbang supaya setiap kawasan menerima tepat separuh daripada jumlah permintaan bagi setiap produk.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Mathematical formulation:**\n"
msgstr "**Formulasi matematik:**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We seek a binary assignment vector $x$, where:\n"
"- $x_j = 1$ assigns market $j$ to Region A\n"
"- $x_j = 0$ assigns market $j$ to Region B\n"
"- The constraint $Ax = b$ must be satisfied, where $b$ represents the target sales (typically half the total demand per product)\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita mencari vektor tugasan binari $x$, di mana:\n"
"- $x_j = 1$ menugaskan pasaran $j$ ke Kawasan A\n"
"- $x_j = 0$ menugaskan pasaran $j$ ke Kawasan B\n"
"- Kekangan $Ax = b$ mesti dipenuhi, di mana $b$ mewakili sasaran jualan (biasanya separuh daripada jumlah permintaan setiap produk)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Cost function:**\n"
msgstr "**Fungsi kos:**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To solve this problem, we minimize the squared constraint violation:\n"
msgstr "Untuk menyelesaikan masalah ini, kita meminimumkan pelanggaran kekangan kuasa dua:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$C(x) = ||Ax - b||^2 = \\sum_{i=1}^{m} \\left(\\sum_{j=1}^{n} A_{ij}x_j - b_i\\right)^2$$\n"
msgstr "$$C(x) = ||Ax - b||^2 = \\sum_{i=1}^{m} \\left(\\sum_{j=1}^{n} A_{ij}x_j - b_i\\right)^2$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where:\n"
"- $A_{ij}$ represents the sales of product $i$ in market $j$\n"
"- $x_j \\in \\{0,1\\}$ is the binary assignment of market $j$\n"
"- $b_i$ is the target sales for product $i$ in each region\n"
"- The cost equals zero precisely when all constraints are satisfied\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana:\n"
"- $A_{ij}$ mewakili jualan produk $i$ di pasaran $j$\n"
"- $x_j \\in \\{0,1\\}$ ialah tugasan binari pasaran $j$\n"
"- $b_i$ ialah sasaran jualan untuk produk $i$ di setiap kawasan\n"
"- Kos adalah sifar tepat apabila semua kekangan dipenuhi\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each term in the sum represents the squared deviation from the target sales for a particular product. When we expand this cost function, we get:\n"
msgstr "Setiap sebutan dalam jumlah mewakili sisihan kuasa dua daripada sasaran jualan untuk produk tertentu. Apabila kita mengembangkan fungsi kos ini, kita mendapat:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$C(x) = x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"
msgstr "$$C(x) = x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Since $b^T b$ is a constant, minimizing $C(x)$ is equivalent to minimizing the quadratic function $x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x$, which is exactly a QUBO (Quadratic Unconstrained Binary Optimization) problem.\n"
msgstr "Oleh kerana $b^T b$ adalah pemalar, meminimumkan $C(x)$ adalah setara dengan meminimumkan fungsi kuadratik $x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x$, yang merupakan tepat masalah QUBO (Quadratic Unconstrained Binary Optimization).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Computational complexity:**\n"
msgstr "**Kerumitan pengiraan:**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Despite its straightforward business interpretation, this problem exhibits remarkable computational intractability:\n"
"- **Small-scale failure**: Conventional Mixed Integer Programming solvers fail on instances with as few as seven products under a timeout of one hour [\\[4\\]](#references)\n"
"- **Exponential growth**: The solution space grows exponentially ($2^n$ possible assignments), making brute force approaches infeasible\n"
msgstr ""
"Walaupun interpretasi perniagaannya mudah, masalah ini mempunyai kerumitan pengiraan yang luar biasa:\n"
"- **Kegagalan berskala kecil**: Penyelesai Mixed Integer Programming konvensional gagal pada contoh dengan serendah tujuh produk dalam masa tamat satu jam [\\[4\\]](#references)\n"
"- **Pertumbuhan eksponen**: Ruang penyelesaian berkembang secara eksponen ($2^n$ tugasan yang mungkin), menjadikan pendekatan kasar tidak boleh dilaksanakan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This severe computational barrier, combined with its practical relevance to territory planning and resource allocation, makes the Market Split problem an ideal benchmark for quantum optimization algorithms [\\[4\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "Halangan pengiraan yang teruk ini, digabungkan dengan relevansi praktikalnya untuk perancangan wilayah dan pengagihan sumber, menjadikan masalah Market Split penanda aras yang ideal untuk algoritma pengoptimuman kuantum [\\[4\\]](#references).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "What makes Iskay's approach unique? {#what-makes-iskays-approach-unique}"
msgstr "Apakah yang menjadikan pendekatan Iskay unik? {#what-makes-iskays-approach-unique}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Iskay optimizer uses the **bf-DCQO (bias-field digitized counterdiabatic quantum optimization)** algorithm [\\[1\\]](#references), which represents a significant advancement in quantum optimization:\n"
msgstr "Pengoptimum Iskay menggunakan algoritma **bf-DCQO (bias-field digitized counterdiabatic quantum optimization)** [\\[1\\]](#references), yang mewakili kemajuan signifikan dalam pengoptimuman kuantum:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Circuit efficiency**: The bf-DCQO algorithm achieves remarkable gate reduction [\\[1\\]](#references):\n"
"- Up to **10 times fewer entangling gates** than Digital Quantum Annealing (DQA)\n"
"- Significantly shallower circuits enable:\n"
"  - Less error accumulation during quantum execution\n"
"  - Ability to tackle larger problems on current quantum hardware\n"
"  - No need for error mitigation techniques\n"
msgstr ""
"**Kecekapan Circuit**: Algoritma bf-DCQO mencapai pengurangan gate yang luar biasa [\\[1\\]](#references):\n"
"- Sehingga **10 kali lebih sedikit gate pembelit** berbanding Digital Quantum Annealing (DQA)\n"
"- Circuit yang jauh lebih cetek membolehkan:\n"
"  - Pengumpulan ralat yang lebih sedikit semasa pelaksanaan kuantum\n"
"  - Keupayaan untuk menangani masalah yang lebih besar pada perkakasan kuantum semasa\n"
"  - Tidak perlu teknik mitigasi ralat\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Non-variational design**: Unlike variational algorithms requiring approximately 100 iterations, bf-DCQO typically needs only **approximately 10 iterations** [\\[1\\]](#references). This is achieved through:\n"
"- Intelligent bias-field calculations from measured state distributions\n"
"- Starting each iteration from an energy state near the previous solution\n"
"- Integrated classical post-processing with local search\n"
msgstr ""
"**Reka bentuk bukan variatif**: Tidak seperti algoritma variatif yang memerlukan kira-kira 100 lelaran, bf-DCQO biasanya hanya memerlukan **kira-kira 10 lelaran** [\\[1\\]](#references). Ini dicapai melalui:\n"
"- Pengiraan bias-field yang bijak daripada taburan keadaan yang diukur\n"
"- Memulakan setiap lelaran daripada keadaan tenaga berhampiran penyelesaian sebelumnya\n"
"- Pasca-pemprosesan klasik bersepadu dengan carian setempat\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Counterdiabatic protocols**: The algorithm incorporates counterdiabatic terms that suppress unwanted quantum excitations during short evolution times, enabling the system to remain near the ground state even with rapid transitions [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "**Protokol counterdiabatic**: Algoritma ini menggabungkan sebutan counterdiabatic yang menekan pengujaan kuantum yang tidak diingini semasa masa evolusi yang singkat, membolehkan sistem kekal berhampiran keadaan asas walaupun dengan peralihan cepat [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

