"  - `3` = number of products (constraints/rows in matrix $A$)\n"
"  - `20` = number of markets (variables/columns in matrix $A$)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Struktur format:**\n"
"- **Baris pertama:** `3 20`\n"
"  - `3` = bilangan produk (kekangan/baris dalam matriks $A$)\n"
"  - `20` = bilangan pasaran (pemboleh ubah/lajur dalam matriks $A$)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Next 3 lines:** Coefficient matrix $A$ and target vector $b$\n"
msgstr "**3 baris seterusnya:** Matriks pekali $A$ dan vektor sasaran $b$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each line has 21 numbers: first 20 are row coefficients, last is the target\n"
msgstr "Setiap baris mempunyai 21 nombor: 20 pertama ialah pekali baris, yang terakhir ialah sasaran\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Line 2: `60 92 161 ... 51 | 1002`\n"
msgstr "Baris 2: `60 92 161 ... 51 | 1002`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "First 20 numbers: How much of Product 1 each of the 20 markets sells\n"
msgstr "20 nombor pertama: Jumlah Produk 1 yang dijual oleh setiap daripada 20 pasaran\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Last number (1002): Target sales for Product 1 in one region\n"
msgstr "Nombor terakhir (1002): Sasaran jualan untuk Produk 1 dalam satu kawasan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Line 3: `176 196 41 ... 46 | 879`\n"
msgstr "Baris 3: `176 196 41 ... 46 | 879`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Product 2 sales per market and target (879)\n"
msgstr "Jualan Produk 2 setiap pasaran dan sasaran (879)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Line 4: `68 68 179 ... 95 | 1040`\n"
msgstr "Baris 4: `68 68 179 ... 95 | 1040`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Product 3 sales per market and target (1040)\n"
msgstr "Jualan Produk 3 setiap pasaran dan sasaran (1040)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Business interpretation:**\n"
"- Market 0 sells: 60 units of Product 1, 176 units of Product 2, 68 units of Product 3\n"
"- Market 1 sells: 92 units of Product 1, 196 units of Product 2, 68 units of Product 3\n"
"- And so on for all 20 markets...\n"
"- **Goal**: Split these 20 markets into two regions where each region gets exactly 1002 units of Product 1, 879 units of Product 2, and 1040 units of Product 3\n"
msgstr ""
"**Interpretasi perniagaan:**\n"
"- Pasaran 0 menjual: 60 unit Produk 1, 176 unit Produk 2, 68 unit Produk 3\n"
"- Pasaran 1 menjual: 92 unit Produk 1, 196 unit Produk 2, 68 unit Produk 3\n"
"- Dan seterusnya untuk kesemua 20 pasaran...\n"
"- **Matlamat**: Bahagikan 20 pasaran ini kepada dua kawasan di mana setiap kawasan mendapat tepat 1002 unit Produk 1, 879 unit Produk 2, dan 1040 unit Produk 3\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "QUBO transformation {#qubo-transformation}"
msgstr "Transformasi QUBO {#qubo-transformation}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "From constraints to QUBO: the mathematical transformation {#from-constraints-to-qubo-the-mathematical-transformation}"
msgstr "Dari kekangan kepada QUBO: transformasi matematik {#from-constraints-to-qubo-the-mathematical-transformation}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The power of quantum optimization lies in transforming constrained problems into unconstrained quadratic forms [\\[4\\]](#references). For the Market Split problem, we convert the equality constraints\n"
msgstr "Kekuatan pengoptimuman kuantum terletak pada transformasi masalah berkekangan kepada bentuk kuadratik tanpa kekangan [\\[4\\]](#references). Untuk masalah Market Split, kita menukar kekangan kesamaan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$ Ax = b $$\n"
msgstr "$$ Ax = b $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $x ∈ \\{0,1\\}^n$, into a QUBO by penalizing constraint violations.\n"
msgstr "di mana $x ∈ \\{0,1\\}^n$, kepada QUBO dengan menghukum pelanggaran kekangan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The penalty method:**\n"
"Since we need $Ax = b$ to hold exactly, we minimize the squared violation:\n"
"$$f(x) = ||Ax - b||^2$$\n"
msgstr ""
"**Kaedah penalti:**\n"
"Oleh sebab $Ax = b$ perlu dipenuhi dengan tepat, kita meminimumkan pelanggaran kuasa dua:\n"
"$$f(x) = ||Ax - b||^2$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This equals zero precisely when all constraints are satisfied. Expanding algebraically:\n"
"$$f(x) = (Ax - b)^T(Ax - b) = x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini sama dengan sifar tepat apabila semua kekangan dipenuhi. Mengembangkan secara algebra:\n"
"$$f(x) = (Ax - b)^T(Ax - b) = x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**QUBO objective:**\n"
"Since $b^T b$ is constant, our optimization becomes:\n"
"$$\\text{minimize} \\quad Q(x) = x^T(A^T A)x - 2(A^T b)^T x$$\n"
msgstr ""
"**Objektif QUBO:**\n"
"Oleh kerana $b^T b$ adalah pemalar, pengoptimuman kita menjadi:\n"
"$$\\text{minimize} \\quad Q(x) = x^T(A^T A)x - 2(A^T b)^T x$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Key insight:** This transformation is exact, not approximate. Equality constraints naturally square into quadratic form without requiring auxiliary variables or penalty parameters - making this formulation mathematically elegant and computationally efficient for quantum solvers [\\[4\\]](#references). We'll use the `OptimizationProblem` class to define our constrained problem, then convert it to QUBO format using `OptimizationProblemToQubo`, both from the **qiskit_addon_opt_mapper** package. This automatically handles the penalty-based transformation.\n"
msgstr "**Pandangan utama:** Transformasi ini adalah tepat, bukan hampiran. Kekangan kesamaan secara semula jadi dikuasakan dua kepada bentuk kuadratik tanpa memerlukan pemboleh ubah tambahan atau parameter penalti — menjadikan formulasi ini elegan secara matematik dan cekap dari segi pengiraan untuk penyelesai kuantum [\\[4\\]](#references). Kita akan menggunakan kelas `OptimizationProblem` untuk mentakrifkan masalah berkekangan kita, kemudian menukarnya kepada format QUBO menggunakan `OptimizationProblemToQubo`, kedua-duanya daripada pakej **qiskit_addon_opt_mapper**. Ini secara automatik mengendalikan transformasi berasaskan penalti.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Implement data loading and QUBO conversion functions {#implement-data-loading-and-qubo-conversion-functions}"
msgstr "Laksanakan fungsi pemuatan data dan penukaran QUBO {#implement-data-loading-and-qubo-conversion-functions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We now define three utility functions:\n"
"1. `parse_marketsplit_dat()` - Parses the `.dat` file format and extracts matrices $A$ and $b$\n"
"2. `fetch_marketsplit_data()` - Downloads problem instances directly from the QOBLIB repository\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita kini mentakrifkan tiga fungsi utiliti:\n"
"1. `parse_marketsplit_dat()` - Menghurai format fail `.dat` dan mengekstrak matriks $A$ dan $b$\n"
"2. `fetch_marketsplit_data()` - Memuat turun instance masalah terus daripada repositori QOBLIB\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Load the problem instance {#load-the-problem-instance}"
msgstr "Muatkan instance masalah {#load-the-problem-instance}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we load the specific problem instance `ms_03_200_177.dat` from QOBLIB [2]. This instance has:\n"
"- 3 products (constraints)\n"
"- 20 markets (binary decision variables)\n"
"- Over 1 million possible market assignments to explore ($2^{20} = 1,048,576$)\n"
msgstr ""
"Kini kita muatkan instance masalah khusus `ms_03_200_177.dat` daripada QOBLIB [2]. Instance ini mempunyai:\n"
"- 3 produk (kekangan)\n"
"- 20 pasaran (pemboleh ubah keputusan binari)\n"
"- Lebih 1 juta tugasan pasaran yang mungkin untuk diterokai ($2^{20} = 1,048,576$)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Convert to QUBO format {#convert-to-qubo-format}"
msgstr "Tukar kepada format QUBO {#convert-to-qubo-format}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We now transform the constrained optimization problem into QUBO format:\n"
msgstr "Kita kini mengubah masalah pengoptimuman berkekangan kepada format QUBO:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Convert QUBO to Iskay format {#convert-qubo-to-iskay-format}"
msgstr "Tukar QUBO kepada format Iskay {#convert-qubo-to-iskay-format}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now we need to convert the QUBO object into the dictionary format required by Kipu Quantum's Iskay Optimizer.\n"
msgstr "Kini kita perlu menukar objek QUBO kepada format kamus yang diperlukan oleh Iskay Optimizer dari Kipu Quantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `problem` and `problem_type` arguments encode an optimization problem of the form\n"
msgstr "Argumen `problem` dan `problem_type` mengekod masalah pengoptimuman dalam bentuk\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align}\n"
"\\min_{(x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_n) \\in D} C(x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_n) \\nonumber\n"
"\\end{align}\n"
"$$\n"
"where\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align}\n"
"\\min_{(x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_n) \\in D} C(x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_n) \\nonumber\n"
"\\end{align}\n"
"$$\n"
"di mana\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"C(x_1, ... , x_n) = a + \\sum_{i} b_i x_i + \\sum_{i, j} c_{i, j} x_i x_j + ... + \\sum_{k_1, ..., k_m} g_{k_1, ..., k_m} x_{k_1} ... x_{k_m}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"C(x_1, ... , x_n) = a + \\sum_{i} b_i x_i + \\sum_{i, j} c_{i, j} x_i x_j + ... + \\sum_{k_1, ..., k_m} g_{k_1, ..., k_m} x_{k_1} ... x_{k_m}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "By choosing `problem_type = \"binary\"`, you specify that the cost function is in `binary` format, which means that $D = \\{0,  1\\}^{n}$, as in, the cost function is written in QUBO/HUBO formulation.\n"
msgstr "Dengan memilih `problem_type = \"binary\"`, anda menentukan bahawa fungsi kos adalah dalam format `binary`, yang bermaksud $D = \\{0,  1\\}^{n}$, iaitu fungsi kos ditulis dalam formulasi QUBO/HUBO.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the other hand, by choosing `problem_type = \"spin\"`, the cost function is written in Ising formulation, where $D = \\{-1, 1\\}^{n}$.\n"
msgstr "Sebaliknya, dengan memilih `problem_type = \"spin\"`, fungsi kos ditulis dalam formulasi Ising, di mana $D = \\{-1, 1\\}^{n}$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The coefficients of the problem should be encoded in a dictionary as follows:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align} \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\\{} \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"()\"}&: \\quad &a, \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"(i,)\"}&: \\quad &b_i, \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"(i, j)\"}&: \\quad &c_{i, j}, \\quad (i \\neq j) \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\quad  \\vdots \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"(} k_1, ..., k_m  \\texttt{)\"}&: \\quad &g_{k_1, ..., k_m}, \\quad (k_1 \\neq k_2 \\neq \\dots \\neq k_m) \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\\}}\n"
"\\end{align}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Pekali masalah perlu dikodkan dalam kamus seperti berikut:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align} \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\\{} \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"()\"}&: \\quad &a, \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"(i,)\"}&: \\quad &b_i, \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"(i, j)\"}&: \\quad &c_{i, j}, \\quad (i \\neq j) \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\quad  \\vdots \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"(} k_1, ..., k_m  \\texttt{)\"}&: \\quad &g_{k_1, ..., k_m}, \\quad (k_1 \\neq k_2 \\neq \\dots \\neq k_m) \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\\}}\n"
"\\end{align}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that the keys of the dictionary must be strings containing a valid tuple of non-repeating integers. For binary problems, we know that:\n"
msgstr "Perhatikan bahawa kunci kamus mestilah rentetan yang mengandungi tuple integer yang tidak berulang yang sah. Untuk masalah binari, kita tahu bahawa:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"x_i^2 = x_i\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"x_i^2 = x_i\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "for $i=j$ (since $x_i \\in \\{0,1\\}$ means $x_i \\cdot x_i = x_i$). So, in your QUBO formulation, if you have both linear contributions $b_i x_i$ and diagonal quadratic contributions $c_{i,i} x_i^2$, these terms must be combined into a single linear coefficient:\n"
msgstr "untuk $i=j$ (kerana $x_i \\in \\{0,1\\}$ bermaksud $x_i \\cdot x_i = x_i$). Jadi, dalam formulasi QUBO anda, jika anda mempunyai sumbangan linear $b_i x_i$ dan sumbangan kuadratik pepenjuru $c_{i,i} x_i^2$, sebutan-sebutan ini mesti digabungkan menjadi satu pekali linear:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Total linear coefficient for variable $x_i$:** $b_i + c_{i,i}$\n"
msgstr "**Jumlah pekali linear untuk pemboleh ubah $x_i$:** $b_i + c_{i,i}$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This means:\n"
"- Linear terms like `\"(i, )\"` contain: original linear coefficient + diagonal quadratic coefficient\n"
"- Diagonal quadratic terms like `\"(i, i)\"` should **NOT** appear in the final dictionary\n"
"- Only off-diagonal quadratic terms like `\"(i, j)\"` where $i \\neq j$ should be included as separate entries\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini bermaksud:\n"
"- Sebutan linear seperti `\"(i, )\"` mengandungi: pekali linear asal + pekali kuadratik pepenjuru\n"
"- Sebutan kuadratik pepenjuru seperti `\"(i, i)\"` **TIDAK** sepatutnya muncul dalam kamus akhir\n"
"- Hanya sebutan kuadratik bukan pepenjuru seperti `\"(i, j)\"` di mana $i \\neq j$ perlu dimasukkan sebagai entri berasingan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Example:** If your QUBO has $3x_1 + 2x_1^2 + 4x_1 x_2$, the Iskay dictionary should contain:\n"
"- `\"(0, )\"`: `5.0` (combining $3 + 2 = 5$)\n"
"- `\"(0, 1)\"`: `4.0` (off-diagonal term)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Contoh:** Jika QUBO anda mempunyai $3x_1 + 2x_1^2 + 4x_1 x_2$, kamus Iskay sepatutnya mengandungi:\n"
"- `\"(0, )\"`: `5.0` (menggabungkan $3 + 2 = 5$)\n"
"- `\"(0, 1)\"`: `4.0` (sebutan bukan pepenjuru)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**NOT** separate entries for `\"(0, )\"`: `3.0` and `\"(0, 0)\"`: `2.0`.\n"
msgstr "**BUKAN** entri berasingan untuk `\"(0, )\"`: `3.0` dan `\"(0, 0)\"`: `2.0`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understand the bf-DCQO algorithm {#understand-the-bf-dcqo-algorithm}"
msgstr "Fahami algoritma bf-DCQO {#understand-the-bf-dcqo-algorithm}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before we run the optimization, let's understand the sophisticated quantum algorithm that powers Iskay: **bf-DCQO (bias-field digitized counterdiabatic quantum optimization)** [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "Sebelum kita menjalankan pengoptimuman, mari kita fahami algoritma kuantum canggih yang menguasai Iskay: **bf-DCQO (bias-field digitized counterdiabatic quantum optimization)** [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is bf-DCQO? {#what-is-bf-dcqo}"
msgstr "Apakah bf-DCQO? {#what-is-bf-dcqo}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "bf-DCQO is based on the time evolution of a quantum system where the problem solution is encoded in the **ground state** (lowest energy state) of the final quantum Hamiltonian [\\[1\\]](#references). The algorithm addresses a fundamental challenge in quantum optimization:\n"
msgstr "bf-DCQO adalah berdasarkan evolusi masa sistem kuantum di mana penyelesaian masalah dikodkan dalam **keadaan asas** (keadaan tenaga terendah) Hamiltonian kuantum akhir [\\[1\\]](#references). Algoritma ini menangani cabaran asas dalam pengoptimuman kuantum:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The challenge**: Traditional adiabatic quantum computing requires very slow evolution to maintain ground state conditions according to the adiabatic theorem. This demands increasingly deep quantum circuits as problem complexity grows, leading to more gate operations and accumulated errors.\n"
msgstr "**Cabarannya**: Pengkomputeran kuantum adiabatik tradisional memerlukan evolusi yang sangat perlahan untuk mengekalkan keadaan asas mengikut teorem adiabatik. Ini menuntut circuit kuantum yang semakin dalam apabila kerumitan masalah meningkat, membawa kepada lebih banyak operasi gate dan ralat yang terkumpul.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The solution**: bf-DCQO uses counterdiabatic protocols to enable rapid evolution while maintaining ground state fidelity, dramatically reducing circuit depth.\n"
msgstr "**Penyelesaiannya**: bf-DCQO menggunakan protokol counterdiabatic untuk membolehkan evolusi cepat sambil mengekalkan kesetiaan (fidelity) keadaan asas, mengurangkan kedalaman circuit secara dramatik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mathematical framework {#mathematical-framework}"
msgstr "Rangka kerja matematik {#mathematical-framework}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The algorithm minimizes a cost function of the form:\n"
msgstr "Algoritma ini meminimumkan fungsi kos dalam bentuk:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$\\min_{(x_1,x_2,...,x_n) \\in D} C(x_1,x_2,...,x_n)$$\n"
msgstr "$$\\min_{(x_1,x_2,...,x_n) \\in D} C(x_1,x_2,...,x_n)$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $D = \\{0,1\\}^n$ for binary variables and:\n"
msgstr "di mana $D = \\{0,1\\}^n$ untuk pemboleh ubah binari dan:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$C(x) = a + \\sum_i b_i x_i + \\sum_{i,j} c_{ij} x_i x_j + ... + \\sum g_{k_1,...,k_m} x_{k_1}...x_{k_m}$$\n"
msgstr "$$C(x) = a + \\sum_i b_i x_i + \\sum_{i,j} c_{ij} x_i x_j + ... + \\sum g_{k_1,...,k_m} x_{k_1}...x_{k_m}$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For our Market Split problem, the cost function is:\n"
msgstr "Untuk masalah Market Split kita, fungsi kos ialah:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$C(x) = ||Ax - b||^2 = x^T A^T A x - 2 b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"
msgstr "$$C(x) = ||Ax - b||^2 = x^T A^T A x - 2 b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "The role of counterdiabatic terms {#the-role-of-counterdiabatic-terms}"
msgstr "Peranan sebutan counterdiabatic {#the-role-of-counterdiabatic-terms}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Counterdiabatic terms** are additional terms introduced into the time-dependent Hamiltonian that suppress unwanted excitations during the quantum evolution. Here's why they're crucial:\n"
msgstr "**Sebutan counterdiabatic** ialah sebutan tambahan yang diperkenalkan ke dalam Hamiltonian bergantung masa yang menekan pengujaan yang tidak diingini semasa evolusi kuantum. Inilah sebabnya ia penting:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In adiabatic quantum optimization, we evolve the system according to a time-dependent Hamiltonian:\n"
msgstr "Dalam pengoptimuman kuantum adiabatik, kita mengevolusikan sistem mengikut Hamiltonian bergantung masa:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$H(t) = \\left(1 - \\frac{t}{T}\\right) H_{\\text{initial}} + \\frac{t}{T} H_{\\text{problem}}$$\n"
msgstr "$$H(t) = \\left(1 - \\frac{t}{T}\\right) H_{\\text{initial}} + \\frac{t}{T} H_{\\text{problem}}$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $H_{\\text{problem}}$ encodes our optimization problem. To maintain the ground state during rapid evolution, we add counterdiabatic terms:\n"
msgstr "di mana $H_{\\text{problem}}$ mengekodkan masalah pengoptimuman kita. Untuk mengekalkan keadaan asas semasa evolusi cepat, kita menambahkan sebutan counterdiabatic:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$H_{\\text{CD}}(t) = H(t) + H_{\\text{counter}}(t)$$\n"
msgstr "$$H_{\\text{CD}}(t) = H(t) + H_{\\text{counter}}(t)$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These counterdiabatic terms do the following:\n"
"1. **Suppress unwanted transitions**: Prevent the quantum state from jumping to excited states during fast evolution\n"
"2. **Enable shorter evolution times**: Allow us to reach the final state much faster without violating adiabaticity\n"
"3. **Reduce circuit depth**: Shorter evolution leads to fewer gates and less error\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebutan counterdiabatic ini melakukan perkara berikut:\n"
"1. **Menekan peralihan yang tidak diingini**: Menghalang keadaan kuantum daripada melompat ke keadaan teruja semasa evolusi cepat\n"
"2. **Membolehkan masa evolusi yang lebih singkat**: Membenarkan kita mencapai keadaan akhir dengan lebih cepat tanpa melanggar adiabaticity\n"
"3. **Mengurangkan kedalaman circuit**: Evolusi yang lebih singkat membawa kepada lebih sedikit gate dan lebih sedikit ralat\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The practical impact is dramatic: bf-DCQO uses up to **10 times fewer entangling gates** than Digital Quantum Annealing [\\[1\\]](#references), making it practical for today's noisy quantum hardware.\n"
msgstr "Impak praktikalnya adalah dramatik: bf-DCQO menggunakan sehingga **10 kali lebih sedikit gate pembelit** berbanding Digital Quantum Annealing [\\[1\\]](#references), menjadikannya praktikal untuk perkakasan kuantum yang bising hari ini.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bias-field iterative optimization {#bias-field-iterative-optimization}"
msgstr "Pengoptimuman lelaran bias-field {#bias-field-iterative-optimization}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unlike variational algorithms that optimize circuit parameters through many iterations, bf-DCQO uses a **bias-field guided approach** that converges in approximately 10 iterations [1]:\n"
msgstr "Tidak seperti algoritma variatif yang mengoptimumkan parameter circuit melalui banyak lelaran, bf-DCQO menggunakan **pendekatan berpandukan bias-field** yang menumpu dalam kira-kira 10 lelaran [1]:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Iteration process:**\n"
msgstr "**Proses lelaran:**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Initial quantum evolution**: Start with a quantum circuit implementing the counterdiabatic evolution protocol\n"
msgstr "**Evolusi kuantum awal**: Mulakan dengan circuit kuantum yang melaksanakan protokol evolusi counterdiabatic\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Measurement**: Measure the quantum state to obtain a probability distribution over bitstrings\n"
msgstr "**Pengukuran**: Ukur keadaan kuantum untuk mendapatkan taburan kebarangkalian merentasi rentetan bit\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Bias-field calculation**: Analyze the measurement statistics and calculate an optimal bias-field $h_i$ for each qubit:\n"
"$$h_i = \\text{f}(\\text{measurement statistics}, \\text{previous solutions})$$\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pengiraan bias-field**: Analisis statistik pengukuran dan hitung bias-field optimum $h_i$ untuk setiap qubit:\n"
"$$h_i = \\text{f}(\\text{measurement statistics}, \\text{previous solutions})$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Next iteration**: The bias-field modifies the Hamiltonian for the next iteration:\n"
"$$H_{\\text{next}} = H_{\\text{problem}} + \\sum_i h_i \\sigma_i^z$$\n"
msgstr ""
"**Lelaran seterusnya**: Bias-field mengubah suai Hamiltonian untuk lelaran seterusnya:\n"
"$$H_{\\text{next}} = H_{\\text{problem}} + \\sum_i h_i \\sigma_i^z$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   This allows starting near the previously found good solution, effectively performing a form of \"quantum local search\"\n"
msgstr "   Ini membolehkan permulaan berhampiran penyelesaian baik yang ditemui sebelumnya, secara berkesan melakukan sejenis \"carian setempat kuantum\"\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Convergence**: Repeat until the solution quality stabilizes or a maximum number of iterations is reached\n"
msgstr "**Penumpuan**: Ulang sehingga kualiti penyelesaian stabil atau bilangan maksimum lelaran dicapai\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Key advantage**: Each iteration provides meaningful progress toward the optimal solution by incorporating information from previous measurements, unlike variational methods that must explore the parameter space blindly.\n"
msgstr "**Kelebihan utama**: Setiap lelaran memberikan kemajuan bermakna ke arah penyelesaian optimum dengan menggabungkan maklumat daripada pengukuran sebelumnya, tidak seperti kaedah variatif yang mesti meneroka ruang parameter secara membuta.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Integrated classical post-processing {#integrated-classical-post-processing}"
msgstr "Pasca-pemprosesan klasik bersepadu {#integrated-classical-post-processing}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After the quantum optimization converges, Iskay performs classical **local search** post-processing:\n"
msgstr "Selepas pengoptimuman kuantum menumpu, Iskay melakukan pasca-pemprosesan **carian setempat** klasik:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Bit-flip exploration**: Systematically or randomly flip bits in the best measured solution\n"
msgstr "**Penerokaan bit-flip**: Membalikkan bit secara sistematik atau rawak dalam penyelesaian terbaik yang diukur\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Energy evaluation**: Calculate $C(x)$ for each modified solution\n"
msgstr "**Penilaian tenaga**: Mengira $C(x)$ untuk setiap penyelesaian yang diubah suai\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Greedy selection**: Accept improvements that lower the cost function\n"
msgstr "**Pemilihan tamak**: Menerima penambahbaikan yang menurunkan fungsi kos\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Multiple passes**: Perform several passes (controlled by `postprocessing_level`)\n"
msgstr "**Pelbagai laluan**: Lakukan beberapa laluan (dikawal oleh `postprocessing_level`)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
