#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conclusion {#conclusion}"
msgstr "Kesimpulan {#conclusion}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "What we accomplished {#what-we-accomplished}"
msgstr "Apa yang kita capai {#what-we-accomplished}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this tutorial, we successfully:\n"
msgstr "Dalam tutorial ini, kita berjaya:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Loaded a real optimization problem**: Obtained a challenging Market Split instance from the QOBLIB benchmark library [2]\n"
msgstr "**Memuatkan masalah pengoptimuman sebenar**: Mendapatkan instance Market Split yang mencabar daripada perpustakaan penanda aras QOBLIB [2]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Transformed to QUBO format**: Converted the constrained problem into an unconstrained quadratic formulation [3]\n"
msgstr "**Mengubah kepada format QUBO**: Menukar masalah berkekangan kepada formulasi kuadratik tanpa kekangan [3]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Leveraged advanced quantum algorithms**: Used Kipu Quantum's bf-DCQO algorithm with counterdiabatic terms [1]\n"
msgstr "**Memanfaatkan algoritma kuantum canggih**: Menggunakan algoritma bf-DCQO dari Kipu Quantum dengan sebutan counterdiabatic [1]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Obtained optimal solutions**: Found feasible solutions satisfying all constraints\n"
msgstr "**Mendapatkan penyelesaian optimum**: Menemui penyelesaian yang boleh dilaksanakan yang memenuhi semua kekangan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key takeaways {#key-takeaways}"
msgstr "Pengajaran utama {#key-takeaways}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Algorithm innovation**: The bf-DCQO algorithm represents a significant advancement [\\[1\\]](#references):\n"
"- **10 times fewer gates** than digital quantum annealing\n"
"- **Approximately 10 iterations** instead of approximately 100 for variational methods\n"
"- **Built-in error resilience** through circuit efficiency\n"
msgstr ""
"**Inovasi algoritma**: Algoritma bf-DCQO mewakili kemajuan yang signifikan [\\[1\\]](#references):\n"
"- **10 kali lebih sedikit gate** berbanding pengannilan kuantum digital\n"
"- **Kira-kira 10 lelaran** berbanding kira-kira 100 untuk kaedah variatif\n"
"- **Ketahanan ralat terbina dalam** melalui kecekapan circuit\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Counterdiabatic terms**: Enable rapid quantum evolution while maintaining ground state fidelity, making quantum optimization practical on today's noisy hardware [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "**Sebutan counterdiabatic**: Membolehkan evolusi kuantum yang cepat sambil mengekalkan kesetiaan (fidelity) keadaan asas, menjadikan pengoptimuman kuantum praktikal pada perkakasan yang bising hari ini [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Bias-field guidance**: The iterative bias-field approach allows each iteration to start near previously found good solutions, providing a form of quantum-enhanced local search [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "**Panduan bias-field**: Pendekatan bias-field berulang membolehkan setiap lelaran bermula berhampiran penyelesaian baik yang ditemui sebelumnya, menyediakan sejenis carian setempat dipertingkatkan kuantum [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

